<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Hi [3dbc],&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;replace the extended ascii character with a space&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
$string =~ tr/\x09\x0A\x0D\x20-\x7E/ /c;
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See the documentation of &lt;c&gt;tr/SEARCHLIST/REPLACEMENTLIST/cdsr&lt;/c&gt; under "Quote-Like Operators" in [doc://perlop].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps,&lt;br&gt;-- Hauke D&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
